0..77 Comment "//! The twin of the model\'s `originOther`: an atom whose type member states a"
78..152 Comment "//! relation and its reflexivity but no transport law. Without the law the"
153..187 Comment "//! relation is no identity system"
188..265 Comment "//! [Program-2013-homotopy_type_theory_univalent_foundations_mathematics], §"
266..345 Comment "//! 5.8, Theorem 5.8.2, so the atom\'s identity stays its own and the relation\'s"
346..389 Comment "//! evidence is no path between its points."
